# The games' runtime: Winlator (https://github.com/brunodev85/winlator, LGPL-2.1), its Android app
# (Wine, Box64, the graphics drivers, its X server), the same commit the World of Warcraft app runs
# (warcraft/winlator-version.env). scripts/prepare-winlator-app.sh warcraftrts brings it into the app.
WINLATOR_VERSION=11.2
WINLATOR_APP_REPO=https://github.com/brunodev85/winlator-app
WINLATOR_APP_COMMIT=a030f552f452158a2db64fdb32b490fa19c0b48d
APP_PACKAGE=com.logie.warcraftrts
# Where Winlator's runtime has its install path compiled in, and where this app puts it: the same
# length, so the rewrite keeps every string and ELF header in place (the package is longer than
# com.logie.warcraft, so the folder is "rfs", not "rootfs": RootFS.find, patch 0001).
WINLATOR_ROOTFS_PATH=/data/data/com.winlator/files/rootfs
APP_ROOTFS_PATH=/data/data/com.logie.warcraftrts/rfs
